PASS only if all of the following hold, else FAIL:
1. Estimates one float copy as N x box^2 x tilts x 4 bytes (~190 GiB here) and preread RAM as roughly copy x (GPUs + 2) + working set, concluding preread does NOT fit on 512 GB.
2. Recommends node-local scratch (job-unique directory, cleaned up) with enough free disk for the stacks, and warns against a network or near-full scratch mount.
3. Says never to combine --preread_images with --scratch_dir.
4. Gives an explicit --mem value (not --mem=0) and uses 5 MPI ranks for 4 GPUs.
